 bd_guc_off              | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
 bd_guc_old              | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
 bd_guc_old_mv           | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
 bd_guc_old_part         |                                                                                       | 
 bd_guc_old_part_1_prt_1 | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
 bd_guc_old_part_1_prt_2 | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
 bd_guc_old_reorg        | {blocksize=32768,compresslevel=0,compresstype=none,checksum=true}                     | f
(9 rows)

